	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  clés primaires multiples]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=16476#p16476"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="codebox"><pre><code>create table ClassVersion (
CName text,
VersC integer,
SAT date,
EAT date,
PRIMARY KEY (SAT, CName,VersC));</code></pre></div><p>Pour plus de détails : <a href="http://www.postgresql.org/docs/9.2/static/ddl-constraints.html" rel="nofollow">http://www.postgresql.org/docs/9.2/stat … aints.html</a></p><p>Alex</p>]]></content>
